  "description": "LineTen messaging v3 opt-in health-check bridge. Adds\n      services.AddHealthChecks().AddLineTenMessaging<TBus>(...), an IHealthCheck\n      adapter that reports per-bus subscription liveness (Healthy / Degraded / Unhealthy)\n      and performs a lazy management-client ping for credential-rot detection. The library\n      stays library-shaped: nothing is auto-registered — the consumer opts in from their own\n      probe registration. See ADR-0008.",
